# package-lock.json — temporarily excluded.
# Reason: npm install on Windows generates a lock that's inconsistent
# under Cloudflare's strict npm ci on Linux (optional/platform-
# conditional deps like @rolldown/binding-wasm32-wasi reference
# transitive deps that Windows-resolved trees skip). Cloudflare falls
# back to `npm install` when no lock is present, which works across
# platforms. Re-introduce a Linux-generated lock once we have WSL or
# Docker available.
package-lock.json

